#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tumor_immunity_analysis
#
# The governing rule of this repository: CODE travels through git, DATA never
# does. Every dataset lives on TACC under $SCRATCH. Nothing in data/ is ever
# committed, from either side of the sync.
#
# The directories themselves ARE tracked, via .gitkeep, so that a fresh clone
# on a laptop has exactly the same paths as the TACC checkout. Code can then
# hardcode `data/raw/<GSEID>/` and be correct in both places -- empty locally,
# populated on Vista.
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

#--- Data trees: structure tracked, contents never -------------------------
# Ignore everything inside, then re-admit the .gitkeep that holds the dir.
data/**
!data/
!data/*/
!data/**/.gitkeep

#--- Claude Code local settings --------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json

#--- Vendor bundles from colleagues ----------------------------------------
# ImmuCA/ and scSurvival-extend/ are their authors' code, extracted here only so
# it can be read. The authoritative copies live on Vista under data/ (212 GB and
# 6.9 GB respectively) and both trees carry notebooks with embedded outputs that
# run to several MB each. Read them locally; never commit them.
/ImmuCA/
/scSurvival-extend/
*.tar.gz

#--- Slides -----------------------------------------------------------------
# The project decks are 16-22 MB apiece. Useful to have locally, not in history.
*.pptx

#--- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
